WEBVTT

00:00:00.590 --> 00:00:03.500
<i>I'm Hasegawa Kouta, 17 years old.</i>

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:06.540
<i>A pretty average second year high
school student that you'd find anywhere.</i>

00:00:07.100 --> 00:00:10.390
<i>The truth is that I have an interest
I can't tell anyone about...</i>

00:00:10.830 --> 00:00:13.270
<i>Which is that I like Sanrio.</i>

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:17.700
<i>But I met a guy who shares
that same interest with me.</i>

00:00:29.020 --> 00:00:30.560
Yuri-chan!

00:00:32.270 --> 00:00:33.590
Found you!

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:36.640
Onii-chan?

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:38.960
Yo!

00:00:41.940 --> 00:00:43.420
Let's go home, Yuri.

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:45.100
'Kay.

00:00:50.970 --> 00:00:52.540
Hey, Onii-chan...

00:00:52.540 --> 00:00:53.140
Hmm?

00:00:53.610 --> 00:00:57.210
How did you know I was there?

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:01.790
That's because...

00:02:37.210 --> 00:02:40.760
My Sister Blue

00:02:42.310 --> 00:02:44.430
All right,

00:02:46.000 --> 00:02:47.510
time to get this going!

00:02:55.020 --> 00:02:57.090
Perfect, right on time.

00:02:58.670 --> 00:02:59.870
And there.

00:03:01.700 --> 00:03:03.790
Oh, Yuri, good morning.

00:03:03.790 --> 00:03:07.120
The crispiness of the fried
eggs today is the best.

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:10.740
I don't want it.

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:27.080
I'm off.

00:03:34.680 --> 00:03:39.350
1, 2, 3, 4...

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:42.820
And Kouta's out!

00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.690
I at least wanted to reach five.

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.300
Okay, it's your turn now Yuu.

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.500
If I reach five, you buy me a drink.

00:03:51.800 --> 00:03:53.460
You're on, here.

00:03:54.700 --> 00:03:58.370
1, 2, 3, 4...

00:03:56.230 --> 00:03:57.730
You're betting with drinks?

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:01.390
Yeah, we found a ball over there a bit ago

00:04:01.390 --> 00:04:03.020
and Yuu said we should play for it.

00:04:03.530 --> 00:04:04.700
Is that so...

00:04:04.700 --> 00:04:06.720
Huh? What? Is something wrong?

00:04:13.520 --> 00:04:14.940
Yuu, you're so cool!

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.440
I know, right?

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.200
What's up with that?

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:21.950
I've been playing soccer since I was
in elementary school, right, Shushu?

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:24.900
Yeah, you quit though.

00:04:24.900 --> 00:04:25.930
Really?

00:04:25.930 --> 00:04:28.960
So that means you two have been
together since elementary school?

00:04:29.640 --> 00:04:30.740
I'm stuck with him.

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:33.200
And that makes thirty!

00:04:33.680 --> 00:04:34.750
I win.

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:36.720
I didn't know you played soccer.

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:37.500
I know, I didn't tell you.

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:38.940
No fair! That doesn't count!

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:42.050
Oh my, so you're the kind of guy who would
break a promise between men?

00:04:42.050 --> 00:04:44.220
That tone isn't manly already!

00:04:44.460 --> 00:04:48.050
It's not manly to throw
a fit when you lose, Kouta.

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:50.400
Besides, if you couldn't even
juggle the ball five times,

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:52.900
one normally wouldn't participate
in a juggling competition.

00:04:52.900 --> 00:04:54.830
Yeah, this was impulsive and reckless,

00:04:54.830 --> 00:04:57.520
and yet you're the one who can't accept
you lost. You're not fair Kouta, so not fair.

00:04:58.360 --> 00:05:00.360
You're the one who's not fair, Yuu!

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:01.360
Kouta!

00:05:01.360 --> 00:05:02.770
Wh-What?

00:05:03.580 --> 00:05:06.230
You've finally gotten used to calling me Yuu.

00:05:06.230 --> 00:05:07.030
Huh?

00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.740
Fine then, but just this once.

00:05:13.640 --> 00:05:15.690
You're in an awfully good mood.

00:05:15.690 --> 00:05:17.960
I'm glad I made a friend.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:23.460
Here you go, Yuu!

00:05:23.750 --> 00:05:25.430
Thank you!

00:05:25.430 --> 00:05:26.720
Here's one for you, Yoshino.

00:05:27.530 --> 00:05:28.550
You sure?

00:05:28.960 --> 00:05:30.890
Yeah, but only if you want it.

00:05:31.380 --> 00:05:32.310
Thanks.

00:05:35.650 --> 00:05:38.920
You hid it from me that you played soccer.

00:05:38.920 --> 00:05:40.310
Let's do it again tomorrow.

00:05:40.310 --> 00:05:42.270
Fine, but we're not betting drinks on it!

00:05:42.820 --> 00:05:45.140
Why did you quit soccer anyway, Yuu?

00:05:45.140 --> 00:05:47.580
Yuu, let's go to karaoke later.

00:05:47.580 --> 00:05:50.070
Sure, I'll catch you on Line later.

00:05:50.070 --> 00:05:51.380
I'll be waiting.

00:05:51.850 --> 00:05:53.030
So, what were you saying?

00:05:53.030 --> 00:05:56.250
Oh, yeah... why did you quit soccer?

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:58.490
When are you going to be able to hang out?

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.250
Sorry, sorry, I've been a little busy.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:03.350
Keep it up and I'm gonna cheat on you.

00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.840
That's funny.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:07.590
Jeez, message me.

00:06:08.500 --> 00:06:09.760
So, what were you saying?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:12.240
Yuu, are you going out with that girl?

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:13.010
Why do you ask?

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.140
She said she'd cheat on you.

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:16.590
That was a joke.

00:06:16.590 --> 00:06:18.350
Kind of like a conversational game of catch?

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.150
I do have a lot of friends
that are girls though.

00:06:21.150 --> 00:06:22.580
Yuu!

00:06:22.580 --> 00:06:23.400
Hey there.

00:06:24.480 --> 00:06:26.470
I'm not going out with anyone.

00:06:28.280 --> 00:06:29.610
I don't have the time.

00:06:33.980 --> 00:06:37.710
I mean, I have My Melody-chan after all!

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:38.620
<b>Factoid: 
My Melody's hood has various colors.</b>

00:06:38.060 --> 00:06:39.750
O-Okay, then.

00:06:38.620 --> 00:06:41.630
<b>Yuu prefers pink, by the way.</b>

00:06:39.750 --> 00:06:41.620
O-Ooh.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:47.920
<i>Now that I think about it, I really
don't know anything about Yuu.</i>

00:06:47.920 --> 00:06:49.380
<i>What I do know is...</i>

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:51.390
That's so gross.

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:01.710
What the heck? It's too heavy...

00:07:02.230 --> 00:07:03.030
Huh?

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:07.190
So these are the new books for the library?

00:07:07.190 --> 00:07:08.960
Yes, that's right.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:11.290
Seems pretty heavy. I'll help you.

00:07:12.700 --> 00:07:15.280
I-It's fine. I can carry it by myself!

00:07:18.310 --> 00:07:19.570
He's so modest.

00:07:20.300 --> 00:07:22.030
Okay, we've got our clubs to go to.

00:07:22.030 --> 00:07:23.290
See you tomorrow.

00:07:23.290 --> 00:07:24.790
Okay, see you.

00:07:25.980 --> 00:07:28.520
Hey, you there! You free?

00:07:29.300 --> 00:07:30.650
Oh, Yuu!

00:07:30.920 --> 00:07:32.540
You're heading home now, too?

00:07:32.540 --> 00:07:33.770
More or less.

00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:36.390
So, are you free, Kouta-kyun?

00:07:36.860 --> 00:07:38.170
You're free, right?

00:07:38.170 --> 00:07:39.770
W-Well...

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.040
Then why don't you come with me.

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:44.760
Wait, what? Where are we going?!

00:07:45.930 --> 00:07:47.200
This is...

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:49.080
What a life saver.

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:52.850
Eggs are 98 yen per person today!

00:07:52.850 --> 00:07:53.750
Eggs?

00:07:53.750 --> 00:07:56.560
Yep! The evening market opens at 4 o'clock.

00:07:56.560 --> 00:07:58.400
I'm aiming for freshly prepared food dishes.

00:07:58.400 --> 00:07:59.470
Okay...

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.370
Well then, let's go!

00:08:03.150 --> 00:08:05.870
Hey, do you always buy this much?

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:10.330
My parents are pretty much never home,
so it's my job to do all the housework.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:13.300
Really? Isn't that tough?

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:15.640
<b>Eggs</b>

00:08:14.670 --> 00:08:15.640
Well, I mean,

00:08:15.930 --> 00:08:17.640
I'm the older brother, right?

00:08:17.640 --> 00:08:19.640
I have to take care of my sister, too.

00:08:22.650 --> 00:08:25.640
Your sister? She's the girl
we met the other day?

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:28.000
Yeah, I'm sorry about what happened.

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:30.550
Yuri's had a pretty nasty tone lately.

00:08:31.180 --> 00:08:32.450
I guess it's her rebellious phase.

00:08:33.990 --> 00:08:35.540
That must be hard on you, too.

00:08:38.590 --> 00:08:39.740
What's the matter?

00:08:39.740 --> 00:08:41.690
Oh, it's nothing.

00:08:41.690 --> 00:08:43.870
All right, it'll be 4 o'clock
in just a little bit.

00:08:44.200 --> 00:08:46.770
I guess I'll preview things before
the evening market starts.

00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:48.710
Yuu?

00:08:52.450 --> 00:08:53.720
Found it.

00:08:55.180 --> 00:08:58.230
Oh, were you going for this one, too?

00:08:59.380 --> 00:09:00.550
I see.

00:09:00.910 --> 00:09:02.930
Well then, here you go.

00:09:07.130 --> 00:09:09.660
Thanks for today, it was a huge help.

00:09:09.660 --> 00:09:11.940
It's not a big deal, ask me along anytime.

00:09:11.940 --> 00:09:14.080
What, really? I can ask you anytime?

00:09:14.080 --> 00:09:16.350
Awesome, I'll do that.
I'll call you about five times a week.

00:09:16.350 --> 00:09:17.950
Five times a week is too much!

00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:22.840
See ya.

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.350
I'm sure things are rough
at home, but hang in there.

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.710
Yeah, come over and hang out next time.

00:09:27.710 --> 00:09:29.360
I'll treat you to a home-cooked meal.

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:30.580
I'm looking forward to it.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:31.900
Bye-bye!

00:10:04.810 --> 00:10:06.450
She's late today...

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:09.630
Mom

00:10:11.940 --> 00:10:12.910
Hello?

00:10:15.290 --> 00:10:17.000
Yeah, fine.

00:10:17.000 --> 00:10:20.030
We're doing pretty well here,
so you don't need to worry.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:22.210
She's not home yet.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:24.660
She should be back from cram school soon.

00:10:25.110 --> 00:10:27.620
Right, yeah, bye.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:35.090
You should just stay home then.

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:41.240
Oh, welcome back, Yuri.

00:10:41.560 --> 00:10:42.490
Dinner is ready...

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:53.750
<b>High School Entrance Exam
Practice Exam Questions</b>

00:10:57.750 --> 00:10:59.320
I'm going to take a bath first...

00:11:00.750 --> 00:11:02.180
Just stop talking!

00:11:02.580 --> 00:11:03.940
You're seriously annoying!

00:11:38.890 --> 00:11:39.860
It's from Yuu?

00:11:39.840 --> 00:11:41.840
Mizuno Yuu: I've caught a cold.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.100
Huh?

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:44.340
Help me

00:11:42.570 --> 00:11:43.780
This means...

00:11:44.340 --> 00:11:49.020
Riverside Kosugi Twin Towers 
Second Building

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.640
he's asking me to come see him, right?

00:11:54.710 --> 00:11:55.550
Hasegawa.

00:11:56.470 --> 00:11:57.710
Oh, Yoshino!

00:11:57.710 --> 00:11:59.500
Yuu has caught a cold.

00:11:59.500 --> 00:12:01.780
Yeah, this way.

00:12:03.140 --> 00:12:04.640
You know where Yuu lives?

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.250
That's right, you guys have been
friends since you were kids.

00:12:07.580 --> 00:12:09.400
Do you live here, too?

00:12:09.400 --> 00:12:10.830
In the other tower.

00:12:13.140 --> 00:12:15.110
You both came!

00:12:15.470 --> 00:12:17.000
How are you feeling?

00:12:17.340 --> 00:12:19.070
Seems I was a little careless.

00:12:19.070 --> 00:12:20.690
Shouldn't you be resting?

00:12:21.210 --> 00:12:23.380
Nah, my fever's gone down already.

00:12:23.830 --> 00:12:25.890
Now then, gimme.

00:12:26.770 --> 00:12:27.570
What?

00:12:27.570 --> 00:12:28.960
My get-well gifts.

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:29.690
Huh?

00:12:29.690 --> 00:12:32.640
A basket full of fruit would be nice.

00:12:32.640 --> 00:12:34.640
I'm sorry, I totally forgot.

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:37.220
Wah, Kouta you're so mean.

00:12:37.220 --> 00:12:38.640
I said I'm sorry.

00:12:39.140 --> 00:12:40.150
What about you, Shunsuke?

00:12:40.390 --> 00:12:42.400
My smiling face is enough, isn't it?

00:12:43.000 --> 00:12:44.220
Thank you.

00:12:44.220 --> 00:12:46.570
You're not even smiling, Yoshino.

00:12:48.730 --> 00:12:51.490
Do you want something to eat?

00:12:54.520 --> 00:12:56.420
Oh, man, it's this late already?

00:12:56.950 --> 00:12:58.380
Sorry for staying so long.

00:12:58.380 --> 00:12:59.470
It's fine.

00:12:59.470 --> 00:13:01.920
Thanks for coming. It made me really happy.

00:13:02.590 --> 00:13:03.670
Yuu...

00:13:03.670 --> 00:13:04.470
What?

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:06.930
Nothing, never mind.

00:13:07.410 --> 00:13:09.430
Okay, now then.

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:12.340
You still have that notebook?

00:13:13.200 --> 00:13:16.350
It's my most treasured recipe book.

00:13:17.630 --> 00:13:19.260
What are you doing?

00:13:19.260 --> 00:13:21.650
It's about time to make dinner for my sister.

00:13:21.650 --> 00:13:24.820
Wha? You should be resting if you're sick.

00:13:24.820 --> 00:13:26.110
I'm better now.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:27.350
But still...

00:13:27.350 --> 00:13:30.240
I'm fine honestly.
Thanks for worrying about me.

00:13:30.630 --> 00:13:33.250
Now then, should I make this today?

00:13:41.700 --> 00:13:42.500
Yoshino...

00:13:54.640 --> 00:13:55.580
Sorry for imposing.

00:13:57.950 --> 00:13:58.750
Who are you?

00:13:59.550 --> 00:14:02.480
Ah, my name is Hasegawa Kouta.

00:14:02.960 --> 00:14:04.780
We came to see how your brother is doing...

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:10.080
H-Huh?

00:14:10.460 --> 00:14:11.580
What're you doing?

00:14:12.110 --> 00:14:14.560
I'm making dinner, as you can see.

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:16.880
It's not like I'm going to eat it.

00:14:17.900 --> 00:14:18.700
Huh?

00:14:20.370 --> 00:14:23.200
Hey, weren't you feeling sick?

00:14:23.200 --> 00:14:24.920
I just caught a bit of a cold.

00:14:25.270 --> 00:14:28.620
A cold? And you expect me
to eat the food you make?

00:14:28.620 --> 00:14:30.180
I'm better now.

00:14:30.180 --> 00:14:32.890
Did you think about what
would happen if I caught it?

00:14:32.890 --> 00:14:34.640
I'm studying for the entrance exams.

00:14:36.060 --> 00:14:38.680
Or were you trying to make me sick?

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:39.640
I wasn't!

00:14:40.340 --> 00:14:42.710
Things would be easier for you
if I wasn't around, right?

00:14:42.710 --> 00:14:44.540
You wouldn't have to do
stuff around the house,

00:14:44.540 --> 00:14:46.610
and you could do whatever you want.

00:14:46.890 --> 00:14:48.450
Yuri! That's enou—

00:14:47.900 --> 00:14:49.740
If I'm in the way, just say so!

00:14:51.230 --> 00:14:53.400
You do this every single day
without me asking you to...

00:14:53.400 --> 00:14:54.490
It's really annoying!

00:14:56.630 --> 00:14:57.970
Aren't you going to say something?

00:15:00.220 --> 00:15:03.000
I'm sorry that my attention wasn't enough.

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.320
You're sorry?

00:15:04.320 --> 00:15:07.760
I say all that to you and all you
can say is sorry? What the hell?

00:15:08.230 --> 00:15:09.510
You're absolutely gross!

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.180
Hey now!

00:15:13.390 --> 00:15:15.020
Wh-What?

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:16.430
You don't need to say things like that!

00:15:16.430 --> 00:15:17.390
Huh?

00:15:17.870 --> 00:15:23.610
Yuu, your brother, went shopping after
school yesterday and cooked for you.

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:27.100
Even today he's doing his best
for you despite being sick,

00:15:27.100 --> 00:15:27.940
and yet you—

00:15:28.380 --> 00:15:30.770
Why do I have to hear that from you?

00:15:31.150 --> 00:15:32.820
This has nothing to do with you!

00:15:32.820 --> 00:15:35.660
It does! Yuu is my friend!

00:15:38.480 --> 00:15:39.910
Friend?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:43.460
And you're collecting Sanrio
character stuff at your age?

00:15:43.460 --> 00:15:44.400
Wh-Why not?

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:47.050
Because it's normally considered gross.

00:15:54.770 --> 00:15:56.730
You're always throwing it away anyway, right?

00:15:57.340 --> 00:16:00.350
You make stuff everyday even
though I told you I won't eat it.

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:01.850
You're being so pushy!

00:16:03.670 --> 00:16:06.050
Then, what should I do?

00:16:07.880 --> 00:16:11.800
I'm always cooking, cleaning
and doing the laundry for you!

00:16:11.800 --> 00:16:14.110
Do you have any idea how much
time that stuff takes?!

00:16:14.110 --> 00:16:15.910
What else do you think I should be doing?!

00:16:16.330 --> 00:16:18.500
I-I never asked you to do any of that!

00:16:18.500 --> 00:16:20.700
You just started doing all that yourself!

00:16:20.700 --> 00:16:23.220
It's not like I want to do it!

00:16:23.220 --> 00:16:24.850
I'd rather be out having more fun!

00:16:26.910 --> 00:16:28.560
Then why don't you?!

00:16:28.560 --> 00:16:30.360
Like I could!

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:33.730
Our parents are never around!
Someone has to do it!

00:16:33.730 --> 00:16:36.390
What's your problem?!
What do you want me to do?!

00:16:36.390 --> 00:16:37.760
What have I done wrong?!

00:16:37.760 --> 00:16:38.560
You're gross!

00:16:40.540 --> 00:16:42.430
You're gross, you're gross!

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.470
You're so gross!

00:16:44.470 --> 00:16:45.350
Yuri!

00:16:57.540 --> 00:16:59.690
Sorry, I'm going to go calm down.

00:17:01.490 --> 00:17:02.660
Hey, Yuu!

00:17:03.220 --> 00:17:04.050
Um...

00:17:08.910 --> 00:17:10.120
Should we go after him?

00:17:10.480 --> 00:17:11.280
Yeah.

00:17:15.010 --> 00:17:16.560
Um... Yuri-chan?

00:17:17.280 --> 00:17:19.790
Why do you hate your brother so much?

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:24.530
I went with Yuu when
he went shopping yesterday.

00:17:25.020 --> 00:17:26.060
And he said...

00:17:26.870 --> 00:17:28.010
Isn't that tough?

00:17:29.290 --> 00:17:30.500
Well, I mean,

00:17:30.990 --> 00:17:32.640
I'm the older brother, right?

00:17:34.410 --> 00:17:37.540
Yuu really cares about you.

00:17:42.930 --> 00:17:44.330
I know that...

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:52.020
I hope Yuu's okay.

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:55.340
He's still sick,
so he shouldn't be pushing himself.

00:17:57.880 --> 00:17:59.130
What is it?

00:17:59.130 --> 00:18:01.850
Nothing, you're pretty amazing.

00:18:01.850 --> 00:18:04.520
Huh? What do you mean?

00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:15.360
This is...

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.660
<b>To my big brother</b>

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:25.660
For when Yuri gets her grades up -
 Reward Cake

00:18:21.370 --> 00:18:25.660
Yuri likes peaches and such

00:18:24.050 --> 00:18:28.180
How long is he going to keep using this?

00:18:46.100 --> 00:18:46.900
Huh?

00:18:48.860 --> 00:18:50.170
I knew you'd be here.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.320
You still have this.

00:19:07.160 --> 00:19:08.310
Gross.

00:19:08.310 --> 00:19:09.540
Shut up!

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:11.010
Get rid of it already!

00:19:11.010 --> 00:19:14.490
Why should I? It's the first
present you ever gave me.

00:19:14.490 --> 00:19:16.470
It's embarrassing for me!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:18.250
How is it embarrassing?

00:19:18.250 --> 00:19:20.970
Liking My Melody as a high
schooler is embarrassing!

00:19:20.970 --> 00:19:23.230
What's the harm in liking it?!

00:19:23.230 --> 00:19:25.180
You used to like Melo-chan, too!

00:19:25.660 --> 00:19:28.140
Don't call her Melo-chan!
You should've moved on!

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.770
I'm never going to move on!

00:19:29.770 --> 00:19:30.890
That's gross!

00:19:31.560 --> 00:19:33.310
Gross! It's gross!

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.730
Yuri! Stop saying it's gross!

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:36.820
Then...

00:19:40.960 --> 00:19:42.790
Don't try so hard to do all the house stuff!

00:19:43.860 --> 00:19:45.160
You've been too flashy lately!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:48.290
How much longer are you going
to keep liking My Melody?!

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:51.500
And... and...

00:19:56.320 --> 00:20:00.880
Be my big brother like you used to be!

00:20:01.570 --> 00:20:02.380
Huh?

00:20:13.980 --> 00:20:15.150
I get it now.

00:20:16.050 --> 00:20:18.570
You don't like how I am
now, do you, Yuri-chan?

00:20:19.160 --> 00:20:20.690
Stop calling me Yuri-chan.

00:20:21.550 --> 00:20:22.760
Not like I can help it.

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.660
I have to be the one to take
care of things at home.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.540
I'm sorry, Yuri.

00:20:30.750 --> 00:20:33.820
Don't touch my hair, it's gross.

00:20:33.820 --> 00:20:35.790
Come on now!

00:20:35.790 --> 00:20:36.900
Take that!

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:39.070
Hey! Stop it!

00:20:39.070 --> 00:20:40.550
Stop saying I'm gross, okay?!

00:20:40.870 --> 00:20:42.370
Gross, gross, gross!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:44.130
Why you!

00:20:44.130 --> 00:20:46.150
Jeez! You're awful!

00:20:47.820 --> 00:20:50.290
You really are the worst.

00:20:55.040 --> 00:20:55.860
Hey.

00:20:58.110 --> 00:21:01.190
I'm sorry for throwing the food away.

00:21:02.190 --> 00:21:04.340
I'll be sure to eat it tomorrow.

00:21:05.920 --> 00:21:08.700
Okay, got it.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:16.730
Um... I guess they managed to work it out?

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:17.710
Yeah.

00:21:17.720 --> 00:21:20.610
You think? What a relief.

00:21:20.610 --> 00:21:24.350
He's been sick so I was worried that this
might make his cold come back worse...

00:21:34.300 --> 00:21:36.340
Why am I the one with the cold?

00:23:20.350 --> 00:23:23.840
Hey, Yoshino, I wanna talk to you.

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:25.380
You're gonna have to come with us.

00:23:26.510 --> 00:23:28.380
What is it, Senpai?

00:23:34.930 --> 00:23:40.650
Next Episode

00:23:36.440 --> 00:23:38.440
Next time, "Hello Friends".
